      "node_id": "kg_doc_3",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "The 1995 Baltic Cup football competition was the 15th season of the Baltic Cup and took place from May 19 to May 21 at the Daugava Stadium in Riga, Latvia. It was the fifth annual competition of the three Baltic states – Latvia, Lithuania and Estonia – since they regained their independence from the Soviet Union in 1991.",
      "depth": 0,
